a092devs NOTICE

This bundle contains native Xposed hooks ported from community Morphe patch projects. Each source is
licensed GPL-3.0, the same license as this repository (see LICENSE at the repository root). The ports
were re-implemented against the NexAlloy runtime patcher API; the target tables and helper logic are
transcribed from the sources below so they can be diffed against them.

================================================================================
VenusIsJaded/Venus-Patches
https://github.com/VenusIsJaded/Venus-Patches
License: GPL-3.0
Ported material: patches/src/main/kotlin/app/venus/patches/PrivacyPatches.kt — the native
(non-Hermes) target tables for "Disable crash reporting", "Disable telemetry and touch logging",
"Disable install attribution" and "Disable advertising identifiers" (Discord 348.10 - Stable);
extensions/font/src/main/kotlin/app/venus/font/SystemFont.kt — the "Force system font" decision
logic (family, weight and style mapping), installed here as a runtime hook on
ReactFontManager.getTypeface with the manager's patch toggle in place of Venus's saved setting.
Not ported: patch-time additions, the `assets/index.android.bundle` (Hermes bytecode) edits, and
the mid-session restart dispatch.
