jkennethcarino/adobo
https://github.com/jkennethcarino/adobo
License: GPL-3.0
Ported material: patches/src/main/kotlin/dev/jkcarino/adobo/patches/reddit/ (Reddit 2026.38.0 -
2026.14.0) — "Disable screenshot banner", "Open links directly" (outbound click tracking and
redirect getters), "Disable home feed auto-refresh", "Disable home screen redirect",
"Make system navigation bar transparent", "Hide upvote scores" and "Hide post view counts".
