jasonwu1994/Gboard-patches
https://github.com/jasonwu1994/Gboard-patches
License: GPL-3.0
Ported material: the flag-family feature patches under
patches/src/main/kotlin/dev/jason/gboardpatches/patches/gboard/features/ together with the
matching extension/<feature>/*Policy.java decision rules (free cursor trackpad, super insert,
emoji size, access points menu redesign, Bluetooth microphone, close proactive suggestions,
access point count, clipboard character limit, flow mode, advanced voice typing, grammar checker,
inline suggestions and key shapes). Upstream rewrites Gboard's flag value getter so its runtime
can substitute the result per flag name; this port hooks the same getter on Gboard 18.4.1
(actb.g(), the name field and value box types match the upstream 18.0.3 bindings) and applies
the same name-based overrides, with the manager's per-patch toggles in place of the in-app flag
settings. Not ported: the features that also replace widgets, layouts, resources or GMS module
requests (OCR module plumbing, AI writing tools backend selection, Rambler toolbar, settings
homepage policy, split keyboard, custom layout editor, symbol picker, manual incognito and the
other custom resources), and the accessibility-layout flag, which no longer exists in 18.4.1.
